        "text_tVJcTg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Customise one of our existing designs or ask for a bespoke design to fit your space and match your aesthetic. Send us a message explaining your customisations, requirements and style ideas then we will give you a quote. We typically respond to quotes based on an existing design within 2 business days, and bespoke design requests within 4 business days. <a href=\"/pages/request-a-design\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Request a design\">Read more</a> about our design process.</p><p>After the design is finalised with the client we begin crafting the piece within 2 weeks. We expect to have your piece completed and delivered 3-4 weeks after the initial quote request.</p><p>The price listed for designs on this website are a good guide for pieces based on those designs, but timber species selection and market availability at the time can change the materials cost.</p><p>Use the contact form, email us <a href=\"mailto:enquire@starandstonewoodary.com.au\" title=\"email Star & Stone Woodary\">enquire@starandstonewoodary.com.au</a> or call 0404278993 for any questions.</p>"
